    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Sending an email to your registered users should be easy.</p>\n<p>With <strong>Satollo Dispatcher</strong> you can create an email in a matter of seconds, using the WordPress classic editor and immediately send it to all your users.</p>\n<p>Of course, you can select the users by roles especially useful on membership sites.</p>\n<p>No tricky configurations at all: only the sender email address and the sending speed. Both optional.</p>\n<p>Compatible with any SMTP plugin.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create and send emails to your registered users in seconds.",
    "description": "<p>Sending an email to your registered users should be easy.</p>\n<p>With <strong>Satollo Dispatcher</strong> you can create an email in a matter of seconds, using the WordPress classic editor and immediately send it to all your users.</p>\n<p>Of course, you can select the users by roles especially useful on membership sites.</p>\n<p>No tricky configurations at all: only the sender email address and the sending speed. Both optional.</p>\n<p>Compatible with any SMTP plugin.</p>\n",
